                            <comment id="16885519" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 15 Jul 2019 18:58:12 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The problem is at Apache.Ignite.Linq\Impl\CacheQueryExpressionVisitor.cs:190 - &quot;is null&quot; special case is triggered instead of producing &quot;= ?&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16885854" author="pavlukhin" created="Tue, 16 Jul 2019 05:36:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ashapkin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ashapkin&quot;&gt;ashapkin&lt;/a&gt;, does not this ticket duplicate &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11984&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11984&lt;/a&gt; ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16885916" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 16 Jul 2019 07:51:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Pavlukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Pavlukhin&quot;&gt;Pavlukhin&lt;/a&gt; you are right, it does. My bad, did not found that one for some reason. However, I&apos;ve started the work on this one, so let&apos;s close &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11984&quot; title=&quot;.NET CompiledQuery won&amp;#39;t work with strings&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-11984&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-11984&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; as duplicate if possible - &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ashapkin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ashapkin&quot;&gt;ashapkin&lt;/a&gt;, any objections?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
